class=home-section-content><div
class="section-title reveal-right"><h3 class="rr-text">Consulting Meets<br>
Engineering</h3></div><div
class="home-section-text move-up" d-delay=0.3 d-duration=1><p
class=mu-text>Harbinger drives business-led transformation by anchoring strategic advisory in deep workforce and learning domain expertise. Our engineering excellence delivers enterprise-grade platforms powered by AI and automation to ensure operational scale. <br>
<br>
With decades of experience across learning technology, publishing, and workforce enablement, we bridge the gap between consultative insight and technical execution. Every solution is architected for measurable impact, ensuring the platforms deliver the high-performance outcomes and tangible ROI required to redefine how your organization works and learns. <br>
<br>
